  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **7 and 4**\n\n→ 3 × 9 × 4 – 18 × 7 + **(72 ÷ 8)** – 21 = 186\n\n→ **3 × 9 × 4** – **18 × 7** + 9 – 21 = 186\n\n→ **108 **– 126 **+ 9** – 21 = 186\n\n→ 117 – 126 – 21 = 186\n\n→ - 30 ≠ 186\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **3 and 4**\n\n→ 4 × 9 × 7 – 18 × 3 + **(72 ÷ 8)** – 21 = 186\n\n→ **4**** × 9 × 7** – **18 × 3** + 9 – 21 = 186\n\n→ **252** – 54 **+ 9** – 21 = 186\n\n→ 261 – 54 – 21 = 186\n\n→ 186 = 186\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n3) **9 and 8**\n\n→ 3 × 8 × 7 – 18 × 4 + **(72 ÷ 9)** – 21 = 186\n\n→ **3 × 8 × 7** – **18 × 4** + 8 – 21 = 186\n\n→ **168** – 72 **+ 8** – 21 = 186\n\n→ 176 – 72 – 21 = 186\n\n→ 83 ≠ 186\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **18 and 21**\n\n→ 3 × 9 × 7 – 21 × 4 + **(72 ÷ 8) **– 18 = 186\n\n→ **3 × 9 × 7** – **21 × 4** + 9 – 18 = 186\n\n→ **189** – 84 **+ 9** – 18 = 186\n\n→ 198 – 84 – 18 = 186\n\n→'96 ≠ 186\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****3 and 4\"**.",
